os.Open wrapped with %w. Expected: every entry carries the chain
*fs.PathError.Unwrap then fmt.Errorf "open document: %w". The errno behind the
PathError goes through a captured variable in os, so by design the leaf is unresolved(memory).
-- args --
parse/parse.go:@open
